<newsitem itemid="82532" id="root" date="1996-09-27" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Chelsea Village reports year pretax loss.</title>
<headline>Chelsea Village reports year pretax loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.95 loss	    vs 1.51</p>
<p> Turnover		   15.95		  vs 13.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Chelsea Village Plc, which owns English soccer club Chelsea FC, said the pretax loss was in line with its expectations and did not reflect the true performance of the group during the year. The group floated on the Alternative Investment Market (AIM) during the year.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 1.98 loss	    vs 1.98</p>
<p> Transfer fees	    2.63		   vs 1.03</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.97		   vs 0.47</p>
<p> Tax			  nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Retained		   2.95 loss	    vs 1.51</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
